Adapted parts, each marked with a header comment naming the source file and commit:

- src/packages.ts: loadPackages, loadPackage, isProvider, hookPackages and piDir from
  src/bundled/pi/host.mjs, ported to TypeScript and pi-durable 1.6.0, with Yewholt's
  reserved extension names and messages.
- src/session.ts (Yewholt.open, codeExtensions): the coding registry from
  src/bundled/pi/host.mjs: CodingTools, then the tool search extension, then the
  packages' extensions.
- src/workspace.ts (WorkspaceEnv): the per-conversation NodeExecutionEnv with its cwd
  at the workspace, from src/bundled/pi/host.mjs; Yewholt passes no inherited
  environment.
- README.md, "Pi packages": the package convention of src/bundled/pi/EXTENSIONS.md.
